  "description": "As I prepare for the Holy Maiden selection, serving the Maya God as usual, my childhood friend and savior in effect \"Ian\" starts acting suspiciously. The moment I begin to doubt him, I keep having dreams where I die and come back to life for various reasons. Along with Ian's strange behavior, disappearances and butchering incidents occur one after another, making everything seem increasingly suspicious. That night, I decided to follow Ian secretly. In the dark night, as I follow Ian into an alley. [A cold corpse's hand is illuminated at my feet.] Seeing the body Ian had killed, I thought that the reason I died multiple times in my dreams might be because of my longtime childhood friend, Ian.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/challenge/list?titleId=830663)      \n[Official English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4683-maya-how-to-survive-in-god-s-paradise)",
